  "question": {
    "text": "The equilibrium constant for the disproportionation reaction $2 \\mathrm{Cu}^{+}(\\mathrm{aq}) \\longrightarrow \\mathrm{Cu}(\\mathrm{s})+\\mathrm{Cu}^{2+}(\\mathrm{ag})$ at $25^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$\r\n\r\n$\\left(\\mathrm{E}^{\\circ} \\mathrm{Cu}^{+} / \\mathrm{Cu}=0.52 \\mathrm{~V}, \\mathrm{E}^{\\circ} \\mathrm{Cu}^{2+} / \\mathrm{Cu}=0.16 \\mathrm{~V}\\right)$ is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$6 \\times 10^{4}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$6 \\times 10^{6}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$1.2 \\times 10^{6}$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$1.2 \\times 10^{-6}$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "The reaction\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n2 \\mathrm{Cu}^{+}(\\mathrm{aq}) \\longrightarrow \\mathrm{Cu}(\\mathrm{s})+\\mathrm{Cu}^{2+}(\\mathrm{aq}) \\\\\r\n\r\n\\mathrm{E}_{\\mathrm{cell}}=\\mathrm{E}_{\\mathrm{cell}}^{\\circ}-\\frac{0.0592}{1} \\log \\frac{\\left[\\mathrm{Cu}^{2+}\\right]}{\\left[\\mathrm{Cu}^{+}\\right]^{2}}\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\nAt equilibrium $\\mathrm{E}_{\\mathrm{cell}}=0$\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\therefore \\quad \\mathrm{E}_{\\text {cell }}^{\\circ}=0.0592 \\log \\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{c}}\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\nor, $\\quad \\log \\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{c}}=\\frac{0.52-0.16}{0.0592}$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore \\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{c}}=1.2 \\times 10^{6}$"
  }
